From 08ac27e271ce60388646f40f024b163384b9e57c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Care <tcare@meta.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Oct 2025 11:25:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] Add support for various commands running under RBE on
 Mac

Summary:
Add additional Mac toolchain dependencies, and turn on RBE for some actions that aren't supported in Linux RBE but seem to work in our systems (we don't use custom RE worker images.)

Metalava is the only one I couldn't get going properly. It seems to be loading an older version of Java than what we want/send to the server. It will stay disabled for now.

Test Plan:
USE_RBE=true

NINJA_REMOTE_NUM_JOBS=100 m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz -k

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: achong, olja, benthomas

Reviewed By: achong

Subscribers: ilyatsunaev, jmgao, #wearables_emulators

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D85971683
